{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:294:171:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/170/dialogueEntries/15/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/170/dialogueEntries/15/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=7]Like half of the glyphs are about how they switch sides, fill her holes, bathe her in their… *ahem* well, you know…", "context": {"actorId": "9", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "gossip/gator/lanoraPart2", "conversationId": 294, "entryId": 171, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[294, 172]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "1a69092c516f8251783f2f32317f520bd4bc3fcaa26456774dc2520bbf43ff9b", "preserveExactly": false, "beforeTarget": "[pic=7]Snad polovina znaků pojednává o tom, jak si vyměňují strany, plní její otvory a koupou ji ve své… *ehm* však víš…", "beforeTargetSha256": "fb961f0571c8ad7c3c2c5264ef589d03b1a78343eee253d7fb8256565930e776", "target": "[pic=7]Snad polovina glyfů pojednává o tom, jak si vyměňují strany, plní její otvory a koupou ji ve své… *ehm* však víš…", "targetSha256": "9bbde93e4a54902ee1cfe41e91f1127666d507fd6e3dc255fe191a80704ba710", "contextSha256": "ea34588d4541b8d2b79382a142fa97fb8db6a566fbf6aa165e8b53b8ccc83df3"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:312:18:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/310/dialogueEntries/2/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/310/dialogueEntries/2/fields/6/value"}], "source": "There's a bunch of glyphs carved here... No idea what it says.", "context": {"actorId": "7", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "examinables/glyphstones", "conversationId": 312, "entryId": 18, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "38f22c9e77489f30200568ab52b9e3f80ba0c13a95f9a776d0588b07c612f17c", "preserveExactly": false, "beforeTarget": "Je tu vyryta spousta znaků... Nemám ponětí, co se tam píše.", "beforeTargetSha256": "f4f76909665c739f6f8f53840fb6e28ee119ef459c91b2337b6c61209889d02c", "target": "Je tu vyryta spousta glyfů... Nemám ponětí, co se tam píše.", "targetSha256": "466a89ffb38998554c709316f3ba60f7a91ad22fed302130a786511ef370e5b5", "contextSha256": "a0425ac87edbd944d055cc10c1ff55f64262ce9826d2d27db65e17a8b452f72f"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:343:7:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/341/dialogueEntries/6/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/341/dialogueEntries/6/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=4]Look, even the glyphs that are broken off of the monolith are glowing.", "context": {"actorId": "9", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act2/capstone/02_ruins_augustus", "conversationId": 343, "entryId": 7, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[343, 8]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "3e5a0ad25828d5962217856c59df1c56a9d733e2b98fe758f110fe71bfdafbd5", "preserveExactly": false, "beforeTarget": "[pic=4]Podívej, září i znaky odlomené z monolitu.", "beforeTargetSha256": "b9e1d9df854d0e966966be5d1b7c2b53e6bbaa76b6e6cf642fa35b4fc8fa4136", "target": "[pic=4]Podívej, září i glyfy odlomené z monolitu.", "targetSha256": "70f9008f1f98732f95a073e98920b33631071f474485895cdba10154c2ca53f5", "contextSha256": "02f0bb6764a91f7bb4333437aaf655a8b09ee9cc92d0d3ba927f2002c96fd5cd"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:347:4:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/345/dialogueEntries/3/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/345/dialogueEntries/3/fields/6/value"}], "source": "Something’s going on.\nSome of the glyphs at the ruins are glowing.", "context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "13", "conversation": "act2/capstone/03_returnToCoyotes", "conversationId": 347, "entryId": 4, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[347, 6]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "dc1e95e795959d60717c043a734747062ae4d0d21d4159f86567cf567602eba3", "preserveExactly": false, "beforeTarget": "Něco se děje.\nNěkteré znaky v ruinách září.", "beforeTargetSha256": "cad4646b25504a88d5a81d1a2718f081d327e3b9a517697e8493a96ae0d8d2b4", "target": "Něco se děje.\nNěkteré glyfy v ruinách září.", "targetSha256": "8991a00d29a605c1e5bf8f273d2a36160a95da6e373a880e0a4bce1f1178d93d", "contextSha256": "a479d094bda1c3324479f85c4917876319b64599b81a8cd34daee52fb7bd2d32"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:357:150:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/355/dialogueEntries/5/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/355/dialogueEntries/5/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=3]Those glowing glyphs gave me some wicked cool ideas.", "context": {"actorId": "10", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "idles/act2/finley", "conversationId": 357, "entryId": 150, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[357, 151]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "a1d48b088f86bed29723ccf294936df0d9fd81b6ec76c442acaa5b1f0954f0ec", "preserveExactly": false, "beforeTarget": "[pic=3]Ty zářící znaky mi vnukly pár fakt skvělejch nápadů.", "beforeTargetSha256": "3352ffd5d27c2f2b5ae953fa31d949e61d07a88285731d23c4133f6927487fc7", "target": "[pic=3]Ty zářící glyfy mi vnukly pár fakt skvělejch nápadů.", "targetSha256": "316ce8a1da7fea5f71b5de1a96f31cb644a6587f5a5db0dea330006e86def396", "contextSha256": "f56965aee3efc26758ef3ad5d779cad1041b09bd4a36dc80ba84e7148af32b11"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:385:716:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/383/dialogueEntries/25/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/383/dialogueEntries/25/fields/6/value"}], "source": "At that point she was just in pure bliss. You could hear it in her squeaks and moans!", "context": {"actorId": "2", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "movies/botbMabelBunniesStory/dialogue", "conversationId": 385, "entryId": 716, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[385, 717]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "17c0eec84e526b6f4a864b6976b4150588daf8d862ff185f4eb754292cc703e4", "preserveExactly": false, "beforeTarget": "V tu chvíli byla v naprostém blahu. Slyšel jsi to z jejího pištění a sténání!", "beforeTargetSha256": "6ca5e5ddf091679c37ee04a416b2fbc66f37c7610fa67205b30ca8408651d087", "target": "V tu chvíli byla v naprostém blahu. Bylo to slyšet z jejího pištění a sténání!", "targetSha256": "33188407a8c92a9e3576e9beb531f93fb634c91911a341ea7ee77507113ddfda", "contextSha256": "baf7c345663080ac10487a650125184d77690717fc1091a73ab5f4cd90b9418e"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:386:716:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/404/dialogueEntries/16/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/404/dialogueEntries/16/fields/6/value"}], "source": "At that point she was just in pure bliss. You could hear it in her squeaks and moans!", "context": {"actorId": "2", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "movies/botbMabelBunniesStory/dialogue2", "conversationId": 386, "entryId": 716, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[386, 717]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "17c0eec84e526b6f4a864b6976b4150588daf8d862ff185f4eb754292cc703e4", "preserveExactly": false, "beforeTarget": "V tu chvíli byla v naprostém blahu. Slyšel jsi to z jejího pištění a sténání!", "beforeTargetSha256": "6ca5e5ddf091679c37ee04a416b2fbc66f37c7610fa67205b30ca8408651d087", "target": "V tu chvíli byla v naprostém blahu. Bylo to slyšet z jejího pištění a sténání!", "targetSha256": "33188407a8c92a9e3576e9beb531f93fb634c91911a341ea7ee77507113ddfda", "contextSha256": "ecb986f6bd20f238ba07d6b123ba9cc5837a50dcc748999c1006c672ca8cc28e"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:389:389:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/384/dialogueEntries/24/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/384/dialogueEntries/24/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=1]In fact, I wouldn’t be surprised if that was the original bird who flew the Bell!", "context": {"actorId": "5", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act2/botbMabel/05_ReturnToMabel", "conversationId": 389, "entryId": 389, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[389, 390]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "9b0f1c5c70de7494cf0934019373817b23ffd770f4db72aadad55c6b0a818cd8", "preserveExactly": false, "beforeTarget": "[pic=1]Vlastně by mě nepřekvapilo, kdyby to byla ta původní ptačí dáma, co nesla Zvon!", "beforeTargetSha256": "1890cc6de2762a1fbca189120fb02b1b3c45fa5406bccede1564aac2c70be1a1", "target": "[pic=1]Vlastně by mě nepřekvapilo, kdyby to byl ten původní pták, co nesl Zvon!", "targetSha256": "1a45b4a29046c3753336383e94f281f47c27e02a7043a6921b0b45b7b92e554b", "contextSha256": "b8bd661af605181795212c7dd4d396273d9a9dd6f7c4609e6080e633e7471ce0"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:446:565:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/445/dialogueEntries/24/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/445/dialogueEntries/24/fields/6/value"}], "source": "No, not that fluid.\nI meant more like pre and cum.", "context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "4", "conversation": "gossip/bear/naughtyTherapy2", "conversationId": 446, "entryId": 565, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[446, 566]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "9b3e0acfe1d99fa483373ea276e72e05e5fb4facf461c11cd1d4830e4501f103", "preserveExactly": false, "beforeTarget": "Ne, tuhle tekutinu ne.\nMyslel jsem spíš kapičky touhy a mrdku.", "beforeTargetSha256": "cce2d57714c747f5557e9fc257163d51e93b55961869282131f94052e3a661b8", "target": "Ne, tuhle tekutinu ne.\nMyslel jsem spíš pre a mrdku.", "targetSha256": "cb606c59c80fe58e5117a5db9e2187fb57a62d9b38c88835da61a5c489e2eebf", "contextSha256": "27ad191f73a32179f008efc8befd07c17237fa3282ccdcd5a02297614b21d77c"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:446:574:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/445/dialogueEntries/33/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/445/dialogueEntries/33/fields/6/value"}], "source": "The longer the session, the more pre,\nand it gets all over the place.", "context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "4", "conversation": "gossip/bear/naughtyTherapy2", "conversationId": 446, "entryId": 574, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[446, 575]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "e688f43ba91fc03df98fdab0185c35505201ef30960a05e55a63000d91c8a329", "preserveExactly": false, "beforeTarget": "Čím déle to trvá, tím víc kapiček touhy\na pak jsou úplně všude.", "beforeTargetSha256": "e48a8dd2e862d72ef0346b309f4d34d7ca4d991f6a159e9be05422fdc074a95b", "target": "Čím déle to trvá, tím víc pre\na pak je úplně všude.", "targetSha256": "cffd62219cd41a5ea41b4257f3f0d24de0abbecb06989ae554e0b7cdf6b4602b", "contextSha256": "2f1128bc24a41aec8857c239ec305d54c292d4b1ac012e6f5124ca9c44b48859"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:446:586:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/445/dialogueEntries/45/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/445/dialogueEntries/45/fields/6/value"}], "source": "Pre tastes a little salty,\nbut cum… not so much.", "context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "4", "conversation": "gossip/bear/naughtyTherapy2", "conversationId": 446, "entryId": 586, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[446, 587]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "4bc4c24a932b63ae5cf719e3ce65bb828888a2e0c2cdd4dd2f93e3a6a03a89b2", "preserveExactly": false, "beforeTarget": "Kapičky touhy chutnají trochu slaně,\nale mrdka… moc ne.", "beforeTargetSha256": "4486c1ef376fa02dce47a8fac002fafaf414d378fbec4f1d77ccd8dba4e1975d", "target": "Pre chutná trochu slaně,\nale mrdka… moc ne.", "targetSha256": "c6d61c7d7bde73efc72f738955783f0cfec68837a03420006bf8379e0f7fff9d", "contextSha256": "d90e3dab1bf9d129fe6d1f12eea0fa494b3fa8359c96584a1a7ef6e4ca51d367"}
